{"name": "Mercy Incore", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/7be42d9473bc3628caa8ae4bbd147794.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b7539fac0b843eca600006617ce23419.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b7539fac0b843eca600006617ce23419.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b7539fac0b843eca600006617ce23419.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Overworld is a realm of medieval floating islands, covered in a mysterious storm. It draws a squad of medieval knights into the Techno bottom-mirrored world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout the journey, the protagonist, Murcielago, will witness both worlds: the surreal, bizarre architecture of the Techno Dimension and the ghostly echoes of the world he leaves behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/3e5da96302ef40575a7f91ad3fa1ea56.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"436\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/e554889250caa0229080b6a070c2d2cb.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/e554889250caa0229080b6a070c2d2cb.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/e554889250caa0229080b6a070c2d2cb.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Replace your frail, primitive armor with crude, jury-rigged gear cobbled together from techno-scrap just to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, your new armor is held together by rust and desperation\u2014but do you really have time to worry about fashion when stronger enemies ambush you from every corner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So here\u2019s your choice:  <br/>Become a techno-beast\u2026 or remain easy prey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/152649c01d272841b8b8dd8614daff0b.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/2f45086e34f6f98adeca85e9e6d373bd.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/2f45086e34f6f98adeca85e9e6d373bd.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/2f45086e34f6f98adeca85e9e6d373bd.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can <strong>morph</strong> traditional knight's\u00a0<strong>Claymore</strong>\u00a0into a <strong>Scythe</strong> or a <strong>Dagge</strong>r on the run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> It\u2019s not about cosmetics\u2014each weapon is a full combat class, with unique strengths and weaknesses against different foes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, you can scratch anyone with a single weapon. But why settle for survival when a single button press gives you the perfect tools for annihilation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/8ab145210ecf1a5dcdb23c5fe6405121.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/a9d73461a0024d2059277686f4d6e94b.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/a9d73461a0024d2059277686f4d6e94b.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/a9d73461a0024d2059277686f4d6e94b.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Fighting in the Underworld isn\u2019t a chivalrous duel for a milady\u2019s kiss. There\u2019s no time for health potions or polite bowing. Every attack fuels your Drains \u2014turbine driven hits that steal health from your enemies. There are no potions, no step-by-step circling around enemies \u2014only flow and pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/e11c244def54bfa389a0c6369918131d.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b131e226d6b61c7a91f688dcc2f8085c.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b131e226d6b61c7a91f688dcc2f8085c.webm?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/b131e226d6b61c7a91f688dcc2f8085c.mp4?t=1785399058\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Even boring actions like blocking, dodging, and acceleration deal damage. Use it to control crowds, crash the environment, or bulldoze through enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rush. Onslaught. Don\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/943ea5b799f924e2529e77e052897146.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"1560\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/de982e5888f22e544071dc32c79daa61.webp?t=1785399058\"/><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/de982e5888f22e544071dc32c79daa61.poster.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"780\"/></picture></span>Bosses in the techno-dimension aren't epic villains \u2014 they're complex, contradictory characters who interact with each other and won't simply fade away after battle. In a realm both alien and hostile, it may be wiser to turn foes into allies\u2026 than to annihilate all life and be left alone with the Draincore's hunger</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"114\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/extras/f0b35171c6dbc5f9a6cede2e2a8dc797.avif?t=1785399058\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was created by single man with huge passion and countless sleepless nights full of insights. Each element from character to stone was made by hand with love <br/><br/>All game music kindly created by RoarBack studio\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Solo indie hack-and-slash. You are a medieval knight with jet booster and transforming sword. Fight your way through a techno-void. Leech enemies\u2019 lives to survive. Escape \u2014 or become a techno-vampire", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780520/3042eafcf662fb84a4c07d56d8b94d6933caad66/header.jpg?t=1785399058", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Hack and Slash", "Action-Adventure", "3D", "Adventure", "Atmospheric"], "developers": "Inspioner", "publishers": "Inspioner", "release_date": "Q2 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3780520", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/sMil7UYm4UA", "first_seen": 1771801200.0, "review_rank": 1096}